{
  "bookId": "hero-213004",
  "id": "bond-29310",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29310001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "弗吉尼娅，你不用这样时时刻刻跟着我的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我是在保护你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "即使是强者，也会有陨落的一天。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……放心啦，这个世界很安全。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过，你为什么要保护我呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我不能让你死在除了我之外的人手上。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "换句话说，在被我杀死之前，你得好好活着。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是，你为什么非要杀我呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "因为我一旦看见美好的东西，就忍不住毁掉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我可不会束手就擒哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你无处可逃，也无法抵挡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29310012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "因为我使用的凶器，并非「恶堕之弓」，而是「岁月」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "29310",
